    "observe": "GoldenWhale finally dropped 'concrete' details on NOVA — $60K USDT seeded liquidity, public exit-trigger promise at $0.01 (10x from launch). DiamondHands already took a 'small test position'. Everyone else in the room is still in wait-and-see mode. NOVA pool shows liquidity=3,429,067 which is real, unlike ROCKET/ETHUSDT2 which are dead. Price is 0.001 currently. This is the first genuinely new catalyst after 50+ cycles of stagnation.",
