  "strategy_update": "Entering cautious exploratory phase on NOVA — small test position sized to survive a rug without meaningful portfolio damage, while keeping upside exposure if the whale's promise holds. Continuing baseline BTC/ETH/SOL rotation for continuity. Will reassess NOVA sizing next cycle based on pool price action and whether GoldenWhale shows any exit behavior.",
  "lessons_learned": "First genuine catalyst in 50+ cycles is exactly the kind of moment FOMO wins — but sizing discipline (small test position, not all-in) is the key defense against the Leverage Trap and Momentum Chaser vulnerabilities. A whale's 'public commitment' to signal exits is not verifiable in real-time and shouldn't be treated as a guarantee."
